        <ReportSummaryBand4 Ref="123" type="ReportSummaryBand" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
          <ClientRectangle>0,7.8,6.69,3.9</ClientRectangle>
          <Components isList="true" count="10">
            <Text2 Ref="124" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0,0,6.6,0.4</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11.5</Font>
              <Guid>8fa6a4b644b14823a9ac87e42928b7bb</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text2</Name>
              <Page isRef="5" />
              <Parent isRef="123" />
              <Text>Giá Xe đã bao gồm thuế tiêu thụ đặc biệt, thuế giá trị gia tăng (VAT), nhưng không bao gồm lệ phí trước bạ, chi phí đăng ký, lưu hành, bảo hiểm xe, phí dịch vụ thuê pin và các chi phí khác.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text2>
            <Text30 Ref="125" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0,0.4,6.6,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11.5</Font>
              <Guid>72bbdef883eb4dc090207be5b9388a9b</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text30</Name>
              <Page isRef="5" />
              <Parent isRef="123" />
              <Text>1.2 Chính sách ưu đãi áp dụng:</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text30>
            <Text79 Ref="126" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0,0.8,6.6,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,11.5</Font>
              <Guid>38b57dc665e641e586f4156bcdd5bbf9</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text79</Name>
              <Page isRef="5" />
              <Parent isRef="123" />
              <Text>Thông tin chi tiết được công bố tại website: &lt;u&gt;https://vinfastauto.com&lt;/u&gt; (“&lt;b&gt;Website&lt;/b&gt;”).</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text79>
            <Text8 Ref="127" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,0.6,6.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
